# The build context of Dockerfile.verify-web. BuildKit reads this file in place
# of the root .dockerignore, which excludes frontend/: with that one, the
# documented build (and the command the sandbox prints when the image is
# missing, aios/maintenance/sandbox_tests.py web_build_hint) failed at its first
# COPY (found 2026-11-09). The image copies these three files and nothing else.
# Guarded by tests/test_gagos_sandbox.py.
*
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
!tools/verify_web_run.sh
